### 7. DELETE & CLEANUP
### ============================================

### 7.1 Delete audit run (cascade delete all related data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/SuccessFactorRBPAudit/deleteAuditRun
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "auditRunID": "YOUR_ID"
}

### ============================================
### 8. COMPLETE WORKFLOW TEST (Run in order)
### ============================================

### Step 1: Get available instances
GET {{baseUrl}}/SuccessFactorRBPAudit/getAvailableInstances()
Content-Type: application/json

### Step 2: Sync users
POST {{baseUrl}}/SuccessFactorRBPAudit/syncUsers
Content-Type: application/json
{"instance": "successfactors"}

### Step 3: Create audit run (SAVE THE ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/SuccessFactorRBPAudit/AuditRuns
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "name": "Workflow Test",
    "mode": "FULL",
    "instance": "successfactors",
    "extractGroups": true,
    "extractRoles": false,
    "sampleGroupSize": 0,
    "sampleMemberSize": 0,
    "sampleRoleSize": 0
}

### Step 4: Check status (repeat until COMPLETED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/SuccessFactorRBPAudit/getAuditStatus
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "auditRunID": "YOUR_ID"
}

### Step 5: Verify groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/SuccessFactorRBPAudit/Groups?$filter=auditRunID_ID eq 'YOUR_ID'&$top=10
Content-Type: application/json

### Step 6: Get risk dashboard
POST {{baseUrl}}/SuccessFactorRBPReport/getRiskDashboard
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "auditRunID": "YOUR_ID"
}

### Step 7: Delete audit run (cleanup)
POST {{baseUrl}}/SuccessFactorRBPAudit/deleteAuditRun
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "auditRunID": "YOUR_ID"
}

